==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|swetly}}, {{m|enm|swetely}}, {{m|enm|sweteliche}}, from {{inh|en|ang|swētlīċe|t=sweetly; pleasantly}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|sweet|ly}}. Cognate with {{cog|goh|swuozlīhho|t=sweetly}}, {{cog|is|sætlega|t=sweetly; with gratitude}}, {{cog|de|süßlich|t=sweetish; sugary}}, {{cog|nl|zoetelijk|t=sentimental}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-sweetly.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Adverb===
